              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">543132a3-f4ab-4f02-9f7d-8f268486ab2e</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Add the dynamic parameter to the App</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">We add the dynamic parameters to the list of parameters of the App here.

First we define the parameters as JSON objects (in the future, there will be dedicated components to do this for all types of parameters).

In our case, we define a list of sliders with identical properties (type, min and max values, precision...).

Then we set the value of each slider from the value imported in the AppBuilder Direct Text Input.
</item>
